This repository adapts the Docker image build and link discovery from
MiaAI-Lab/GLM-5.3-Flash-DGX-Sparks-1104, an Apache-2.0 recipe. Changes made
for this adaptation: the image builds from a local TensorFold checkout without
applying engine patches or adding vision codecs; the build includes the GLM-5.3
native targets and xgrammar v0.2.8; and link discovery is integrated into this
launcher for its two ranks, with environment overrides.

The `scripts/memavail.sh` helper, preflight checks, memory guard rule, and
readiness smoke test are adapted from
MiaAI-Lab/GLM-5.3-Flash-DGX-Sparks-1104, licensed under Apache-2.0.

The Apache License, Version 2.0 applies to the adapted recipe material. It does
not change the license or terms of TensorFold, model weights, xgrammar, or other
third-party work included or downloaded separately.
